---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { DISCLAIMER, REPO_URL, TELEGRAM_URL, X_URL } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="What ccip.dev is, where its numbers come from, and who runs it.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About ccip.dev</h1>
    <p>
      ccip.dev follows every mainnet Chainlink CCIP message since the first one on 2023-07-06: live as it happens, with daily
      history, top lanes, tokens and senders, records, and the Chainlink Reserve.
    </p>
    <p>
      Messages come from Chainlink's public CCIP API. Token values use DefiLlama prices. Every figure links to the
      <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>, which explains how it is measured and how it compares with other sources.
    </p>
    <p>
      The data is free to use with credit: <em>Source: ccip.dev</em>. The JSON files behind every page are at
      <code>https://data.ccip.dev/v1/</code>, for example <code>history.json</code>. They update every few minutes, so please
      fetch each one at most once a minute; requests are rate-limited.
    </p>
    <p>Chain icons: Chainlink documentation. Logos are trademarks of their respective owners.</p>
    <p><strong>{DISCLAIMER}.</strong> ccip.dev is a community project. The code is open source on <a href={REPO_URL}>GitHub</a>.</p>
    <p>Follow along on <a href={X_URL}>X @ccipdev</a> and the <a href={TELEGRAM_URL}>t.me/ccipdev</a> Telegram channel.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
